        "passageText": "TEST This season's excellent weather has yielded a substantial harvest of fruits and wishing to donate surplus produce to community organizations can do so by visiting vegetables, in many cases more than growers may find buyers for. Those of you Vosey Farm and Garden's Web site (www.vfgrdn.org), where you will find our list of drop-off locations. If you need us to come to you instead, please contact us. We will reach out to one of the many independent truck drivers who have kindly volunteered to transport and guickly distribute your food donations to vetted groups that need it. Check our Web site for more information about this service as well as for insights into topics related to farming and gardening in the Northern Great Plains region.",
