        "passageText": "TEST Skyler Airlines employs more than 20,o00 people from all over the world. We're background, there's probably a place for you on our team. Skyler employees enjoy growing fast andhavemanypositionsavailable.-[1]- .Soregardlessofyour many perks. -[2].For example, our discount program enables them to fly to any of our destinations for a fraction of the average ticket price.-[3]-.We offer upward and global mobility, tuition reimbursement, a mentorship program, and a generous,,compensation, package. -[4] .Annual paid, vacations enable a comfortable work-life balance. It's no wonder that Skyler Airlines was named \"\"Best Airline to Work For\" by Travel Vista Jourmal three years in a row.",
