        "passageText": "GaryWendel (7:40A.M.) Goodmorning, team. Can you share the current status of your projects, please? Jing Yu (7:42A.M.) I metwiththeclientlastweektoconfirmthestartdateforPhaseBofthePalisade project. Robbie Zuniga (7:43 A.M.) Iam headed to the job sitenow for the Riverview project. The rain last week delayed pouring the concrete for the sidewalks. Iwill check the conditions this morning to see if thesituation has improved. Gary Wendel (7:44A.M.) When will Phase Bof thePalisadeproject begin? Jing Yu (7:46A.M.) Wewill breakground inMarchandplantohavethebuildingcompletedbyNovember. Gary Wendel (7:47 A.M.) That's good news about the March start date. Iam sure the client is happy about that. GaryWendel (7:50A.M.) Robbie, let me know what you find out about the site conditions. Perhaps Nathan Burry can help at the site. He's our most knowledgeable concrete finisher. Robbie Zuniga (7:55A.M.) Actually, I'mmeetingNathanatthesitethismorning, so I'll gethisopiniononwhenwe canpour the concrete. The rest of theproject is on hold until we can do this. Gary Wendel (7:57 A.M.) Keepmeposted. I don'twantto rush it if it'sstill toowet. At thesametime, the Riverviewprojectisalreadybehindschedulebecauseofequipmentproblemsandlate deliveryofbuildingmaterials. Robbie Zuniga (7:58A.M.) Will do.",
