        "passageText": "From: melissa@grandgrainsbakery.com\nTo: elinorotero@webmail.com\nDate: October28 Re: Desserts Dear Ms. Otero, I just followed up with our baker about your request to have an assortment of desserts instead of one large cake for the party you are hosting at your home on November 7. We suggest ordering three dessert pieces per person. The cost for three desserts is between s10 and s12 per person. Our most popular desserts are the mini cheesecakes, the berry tartlets, and the brownies. I know you are using a separate caterer for the lunch, and they will help serve and clean up after the party. You also mentioned that you were considering whether to put the dessert table in your backyard or inside your house. Just keep in mind that if you order the cheesecakes, they should not be left out for more than two hours. If you give us very appropriate place without disturbing the party. specific instructions about where to setup thedesserts, our staff can leave them in the Once you make your dessert choices, simply let us know how many guests you expect, and we can take care of the rest. Melissa Luhya Grand Grains Bakery",
