        "questionNum": "151",
        "passageTitle": "Questions 151-152 refer to the following e-mail.",
        "passageText": "To: BinduGil<bgil@opalmail.com>\nFrom: NeelaBalay<n_balay@celebrate.com>\nDate: June 18\nSubject: Follow-up Dear Ms. Gil, Regarding our telephone conversation earlier today, here in writing is the change I would like to make to Saturday's delivery. I am requesting that you now deliver the flowers to the Grand Dining Room at the Kaltan banquet hall manager contacted me just last night to inform me about an electrical system Hotel instead of the Saji Banquet Hall. I apologize for this last-minute switch, but the malfunction that will require a weekend repair. Since the office party I am planning cannot be postponed, I have had to reserve this other venue. I would appreciate receiving the delivery by 4:00 P.M. Best regards, Neela Balay",
