            "text": "Jobs Coming to Willettville release announcing the job fair. WILLETTVILLE(March8)—Tanney's 6:30P.M.onThursday, March20,in the The event will be held from 9:30 A.M. to Discount Mart (TDM) announced today that it will hold a job fair in Willettville later this ballroom of the Twin Ridges Hotel. Details can be found by visiting tdm.com/careers. month. The company, headquartered in nearby Lyter City, is looking to fill 300 the staff we need to meet the anticipated \"This recruiting event will help us find positions at its new distribution center, set to open here next month. In addition to seeking Mr. Siler.\"TDM continues to expand its growth in demand for our products,\" said technicians and supervisors, the company wants to fill positions in the processing, position in discount retail. So far this year, we have opened three stores, and we have stock inspection, and maintenance departments. year.\" Mr. Siler noted, moreover, that TDM five more slated to open by the end of next for qualified technical staff in particular,\" automated systems, which creates a big need \"TDM's distribution centers use modern part-time employment. offers competitive wages for full-time and Kent Siler, TDM's president, said in a press",
